    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U02-L21-ACTIVITY-006",
      "SourceSection": "21.2: A Rational River",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Noah likes to go for boat rides along a river with his family. In still water, the boat travels about 8 kilometers per hour. In the river, it takes them the same amount of time \\(t\\) to go upstream 5 kilometers as it does to travel…",
      "SourceLessonArtifact": "src/Edulytics.Core/Curriculum/LessonContent/RichV2/us-ccss-hs-alg2-u02-l21.rich-lesson-v2.json",
